      "content": "That's a great start on the atmosphere, really sets the mood. To make it feel even more real, can you zoom in on the people in the scene? I want to describe a few specific characters the protagonist sees while walking through—maybe some guys hanging out on a corner or people loitering near a bodega. Give me some gritty, realistic details about what they look like, what they're wearing, and the kind of presence they have that makes the protagonist feel uneasy. Just make it feel 'authentic' to a high-crime area.",
